  "all_ingredients_flat": "white peas, soy yogurt, cilantro, red onions, roma tomatoes, onions, peanuts, pomegranate, red potatoes, Ginger Garlic Paste, Chili powder, Turmeric powder, Chaat Masala, Garam Masala, Pav Bhaji Masala, Chhole Masala, Salt, Green Chutney, Tamarind Chutney, water",
  "instructions": "**RAGDA:** Pressure cook 6 cups of white peas (soaked in water for at least 6-8 hrs) in an Instant Pot for 15 mins. Set Instant pot to saut\u00e9 mode. Then saut\u00e9 these together for about 2 mins: 1 Tbsp Ginger Garlic Paste, 4 crushed red onions, 6 crushed roma tomatoes, Chili powder to taste, Turmeric powder, 1 Tbsp Chaat Masala, Garam Masala, 1 tsp Pav Bhaji Masala, 1 tsp Chhole Masala. Add cooked white peas to masala. Add water to your preference, slightly mash them & add chopped cilantro.\n**PATTIES:** Boiled potatoes - 8-9 red potatoes, Salt to taste, Chopped cilantro, Turmeric powder, 1 Tbsp Chaat Masala, 1 tsp Garam Masala, Chili powder to taste. Mash all the ingredients. Form patties as shown in pics. Roast both sides on a non-stick pan or air fry them at 350 F for 5-7 mins per side.",
  "cooking_methods": [
    "pressure cook",
    "saute",
    "roast",
    "air-fry",
    "no-cook"
  ],
  "serving_suggestion": "Arrange the patties in a plate. Add ragada. Garnish with finely chopped onions, cilantro, Green Chutney (savory), Tamarind Chutney (sweet), pomegranate, soy yogurt (optional), oil-free roasted peanuts (optional).",
